  "body": "I'm trying to setup Synapse on a server (Ubuntu 20.10); but I get a 400 bad request (\"Shared secret registration is not enabled\") when I try to register a new user (`register_new_matrix_user -c homeserver.yaml http://localhost:8008/`).\r\n\r\n- I already tried to add `enable_registration: true`\r\n- `registration_shared_secret` is also set (not by me, but during during setup)\r\n- Tried rebooting the entire system\r\n- Tried reinstalling all dependencies; but they all seem already installed without any issues\r\n\r\nI also tried asking in the `#synapse:matrix.org` support room, but no one seems to have any idea what's causing this.\r\n",
